<title>JAPAN: Advantest sees record 96/97 current profit.</title>
<headline>Advantest sees record 96/97 current profit.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Advantest Corp said on Friday that its parent current profit was likely to hit a record of around 38 billion yen in 1996/97.</p>
</text>
